  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>댬<ruby>댬<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>빵<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hk5Z0NP2yjs?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>个<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>世界<rt>세ˋ개</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>每日<rt>뮈ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>認真<rt>띤진ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiàm-jît-e-sè-kai goà mûi-rît lông-rin-jîn’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>主人<rt>주ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-e-siong-sùi’e bāng goà si-goà kā-kī’e jû-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>做工<rt>죄ˋ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>面色<rt>삔셱</rt></ruby> <ruby>煞<rt>쇃ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiam-tiam-joè-kâng tiam-tiam-phâh-pia̰ tiam-tiām lêh-khoà̰-láng’e bin-siek soâh-m-jâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天光<rt>틸ˉ긍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>了後<rt>ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變成<rt>볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>款<rt>콴ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thḭ̄-kn̂g liâu-āu goà bêh-pien-sieng-siâ̰-khoàn’e láng?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>細漢<rt>쇠ˋ한</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>相片<rt>셩ˋ필</rt></ruby> <ruby>一張<rt>짇듈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一張<rt>짇듈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>紀念<rt>기ˋ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soè-han’e siòng-phḭ jit-tiṵ̄-jit-tiṵ̂ lông-si-kì-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kân lêh-jàu lông-bo-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>走揣<rt>ᄌᅷˆ췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>前路<rt>졩러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>坎欹<rt>캄ˆ캬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jâu-chue-goà’e hī-bāng m-koân-jieng-lōr khâm-khiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tio-sǹg-kōr-toâ̰ ya-ài-jāi-yà̰ goà wi-sià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>用心<rt>영심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yong-sîm lêh-chue-goà’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>開往<rt>퀴ˉ엉ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>未來<rt>삐래ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>船隻<rt>준쟣</rt></ruby> <ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby> <ruby>靠岸<rt>코ˋ활ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khūi-ông-bi-lái’e jun-jiah tân-thai-kuè-khi khò-hoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>體會<rt>테ˆ훼-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>喙<rt>취</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>快活<rt>퀼ˋ왛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thê-hue-kông-boe-chût-chui’e khṵ̀i-oâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>隨<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>物件<rt>밓걀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>隨<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑-</rt></ruby><ruby>擔<rt>달ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>底<rt>되ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>換<rt>왈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sui-láng’e mih-kiā̰ sui-lang-tâ̰ bo-toê-oā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>做工<rt>죄ˋ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>面色<rt>삔셱</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiam-tiam-joè-kâng tiam-tiam-phâh-pia̰ tiam-tiam-lêh-khoà̰-láng’e bin-siek ya-ài-jāi-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天光<rt>틸ˉ긍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>了後<rt>ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變成<rt>볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>款<rt>콴ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thḭ̄-kn̂g liâu-āu goà bêh-pien-sieng-siâ̰-khoàn’e láng?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>細漢<rt>쇠ˋ한</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>相片<rt>셩ˋ필</rt></ruby> <ruby>一張<rt>짇듈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一張<rt>짇듈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>紀念<rt>기ˋ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soè-han’e siòng-phḭ jit-tiṵ̄-jit-tiṵ̂ lông-si-kì-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kân lêh-jàu lông-bo-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>走揣<rt>ᄌᅷˆ췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>前路<rt>졩러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>坎欹<rt>캄ˆ캬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jâu-chue-goà’e hī-bāng m-koân-jieng-lōr khâm-khiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tio-sǹg-kōr-toâ̰ ya-ài-jāi-yà̰ goà wi-sià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>用心<rt>영심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>揣<r